WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
This show contains scenes that some viewers may find disturbing.​ Viewer discretion ​is ​advised.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.090
<i>That's...</i>

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:21.750
Oh, you're back!

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.500
Thank you.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:35.850
That is the Hawk of Light. 
The savior of the world.

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:38.570
Or perhaps...

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:42.510
<b><i>Winter's Journey</i></b>

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:21.030
Hey, come on now...

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:23.920
Guts, she also ate your share.

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:25.430
That's fine.

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:28.450
But you need to eat, too!

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:31.490
Never thought I'd see Guts so responsible.

00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:32.920
It's rather unexpected.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:36.430
But he may be overdoing it a bit...

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:40.190
Puck, what's your homeland like?

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:43.570
Well, it's just the best!

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:45.240
Elfhelm!

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:48.550
A utopia that lies on the Western Sea.

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:51.610
Flowers are always blooming, 
birds are always singing,

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:53.180
and elves are always dancing.

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:54.270
Open all year round.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:56.890
An elven paradise, where it's always spring.

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:59.450
Oh, my beautiful home.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:04.100
If it's that great a place, 
why did you leave?

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.510
I got bored of it.

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:10.830
<i>To think I'd have to rely on him.</i>

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:15.590
<i>But right now, I have to cling 
to any slim hope there is.</i>

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.220
Guts, you should sleep a bit, too.

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:19.640
Before night falls.

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:20.490
It'll be fine.

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:22.600
If something happens, I'll wake you.

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:27.280
Thanks, I'll take you up on that. 
I'm counting on you.

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:28.110
Roger.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:40.070
Will you sleep? Will you dream?

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:42.360
Dream about him?

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:46.030
Why? Why not pursue him?

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:49.520
Let's go. Let's go to him.

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:52.260
Let's give him some iron.

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:58.280
Because of this woman with 
you? Is she that precious?

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:00.240
More than Griffith?

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:05.950
That woman is no longer the 
warrior you used to know.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.720
This woman is

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:13.100
a sacrifice that lives only so 
you can pine after Griffith.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.150
Go away.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:17.650
There are better ways to 
deal with sacrifices.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:19.990
See? If you do this,

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:23.540
you'll connect with Griffith 
on a much deeper level.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.040
Stop!

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:27.790
That is what you long for.

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:41.680
When did the sun set?

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:45.310
I was a fool to believe in you.

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:51.180
It isn't true.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.270
It isn't...

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:01.580
Well, at least

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:06.070
we found a place to shelter 
from the snow and wind.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:11.590
A quiet time like this definitely makes 
you feel you're on a journey.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:13.180
How?

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:16.350
It's cold, I'm hungry, this is horrible.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:19.140
Then, shall we give up on 
the Black Swordsman

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:20.520
and return to the Holy See?

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.100
I have no intention of doing that.

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:25.880
Are you saying that I should tell the 
supreme court that monsters

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:29.270
swallowed the Holy Iron Chain 
Knights and the refugees?

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:33.360
Rather than only being replaced, 
we'd probably face an inquisition!

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:36.860
And I have no plans to 
return to that mansion.

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:42.580
By the way, why don't you 
come a little closer?

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:45.370
No... Since I'm acting as lookout.

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:53.940
<i>The first time I met Lady Farnese 
was also on a night like this...</i>

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:23.540
A strange rabbit...

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:24.950
Insolent boy!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:31.960
Listen well.

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:35.210
I'm the one who saved your life.

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:38.460
So from today on, you belong to me.

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:40.590
Swear it.

00:06:41.070 --> 00:06:43.180
Swear your complete obedience.

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:45.430
Yes, Lady Farnese.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:48.050
At a nobleman's mansion?

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:52.190
I was told to work and live 
there, starting tomorrow.

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:53.840
The pay is pretty good,

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:58.090
so I'm thinking of hiring a 
maid to take care of you.

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:01.850
This is the perfect opportunity 
to get closer to the nobility.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.700
Be sure to work hard.

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:04.780
Yes.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:09.370
<i>The Vandimion family. Its wealth 
is said to be world class,</i>

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:12.210
<i>exceeding a country's national budget.</i>

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:17.910
You poor thing... 
I'm surprised you've lasted.

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:19.440
Usually, Lady Farnese's servants

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:23.540
can't handle her awful disposition, 
and end up running away.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:27.470
One child even had her clothes set 
on fire, severely burning her.

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:33.150
<i>Everyone in the mansion feared 
and loathed the little tyrant,</i>

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:35.730
<i>as if touching an abhorrent boil.</i>

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:39.980
<i>But she was that way for a reason.</i>

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:43.580
<i>Federico, head of the 
Vandimion household,</i>

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:47.220
<i>was passionate about his work 
and was never home.</i>

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:51.730
<i>Her mother left her at home, 
to lead a life of debauchery.</i>

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:56.890
<i>Lady Farnese was left all alone, 
unsupervised, in a vast mansion.</i>

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:02.240
<i>She lived as she pleased, 
in a gigantic cage.</i>

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:06.370
Listen well.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:10.850
You will stay here and hold 
my hand all night.

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:11.470
Yes, my lady.

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:14.140
No!

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:17.490
Do something about that thunder!

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.980
That's out of my hands—

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:23.740
Lady Farnese!

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:27.990
Lady Farnese?!

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:32.210
Oh, storm...

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:35.220
I just need to become a storm, as well!

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:38.500
<i>There was something truly 
ghastly about that sight.</i>

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:44.170
<i>One snowy night, Lord Federico 
returned home.</i>

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:47.060
<i>A year had passed since I'd been hired,</i>

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:49.280
<i>but it was my first time seeing him.</i>

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:50.760
Father!

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:55.590
Wait a while, Farnese. I'm in the 
middle of discussing business.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:59.370
Yes, Father.

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:03.960
Oh? And what is that filthy doll?

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:04.610
Eh?

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:08.630
Throw it away. I shall buy as 
many new ones as you'd like.

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:09.090
Um...

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:11.150
But for now, just run along.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:12.030
Um...

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:15.810
Yes, Father...

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:19.760
<i>Later, a servant at the mansion explained</i>

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:24.970
<i>that the doll was a sentimental 
memento for Lady Farnese,</i>

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:28.020
<i>having been bought by her father</i>

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:31.130
<i>on the sole family trip they'd taken.</i>

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:33.600
Lady Farnese—

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:34.840
Go away.

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:38.260
Or I'll burn you, too.

00:09:46.570 --> 00:09:48.680
What is it, my lord?

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:51.320
What is that around your neck?

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:52.800
This?

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.330
Let me have a closer look.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:58.080
Ah... I thought so.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:01.580
<i>My first meeting with my father.</i>

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:05.460
The Vandimion family already 
has three boys

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:09.170
fighting to be the next family head.

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:14.780
In order to avoid needless 
conflict and confusion,

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:18.230
I ask that you keep your 
identity confidential.

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:22.610
Would you go to see my mother?

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.850
In due course.

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:27.110
<i>It was a polite dismissal.</i>

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:29.410
<i>With his power,</i>

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:33.250
<i>finding my mother should have 
been a simple matter.</i>

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.620
<i>My poor mother...</i>

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:42.520
Lady Farnese, may I have this dance?

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:43.660
Pardon me.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:45.380
Serpico, dance with me.

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:49.530
She's so unapproachable. 
Such a difficult person.

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:53.060
Does she plan to dance only 
with her bodyguard?

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:55.390
Who is he, anyway?

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:55.110
From what I hear,

00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:57.880
he has a title, but originally,

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:01.010
he was Lady Farnese's servant.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:02.890
He was a commoner?

00:11:04.270 --> 00:11:09.740
Apparently, Lord Federico himself, 
her father, is his legal guardian.

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:11.950
Lady Farnese?

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:12.530
He's done a good job of assimilating.

00:11:15.060 --> 00:11:17.820
I shan't allow you to speak ill of my guest!

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:18.870
Lady Farn...

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:20.540
This calls for a duel!

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:22.520
However, as I am a woman,

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:25.330
you'll fight the one of whom 
you spoke so rudely.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.540
<i>I knew it...</i>

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:31.970
Does this mean we have a draw?

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:33.010
Well done.

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:33.850
Not at all.

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:36.630
Your skill is such that I can hardly 
believe you were a commoner.

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:40.850
No surprise that you are the guard for 
Vandimion household's young lady.

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:44.630
I apologize for my earlier 
rudeness, Lady Farnese.

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:52.610
This wound is from last week...

00:11:52.610 --> 00:11:54.760
This and this one from last month.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:59.260
At this rate, you'll end up a patchwork doll.

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:01.950
Why don't you make every effort?

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:06.570
With your skill, you should be 
capable of winning any duel!

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:10.430
You think too highly of me.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.490
Very well, then...

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:17.840
I suppose seeing a patchwork doll 
will be quite amusing next time.

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:32.980
Marriage?

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:36.550
He is a very generous member 
of the royal family.

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:41.240
He knows of your awful temperament, 
but still agreed to meet you.

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:45.810
I know I needn't say it, but this 
is also for our family's good.

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:44.740
U-Um...

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:46.740
Do you understand?

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:51.270
Yes, Father.

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:54.520
Lady Farnese! Lady Farne—

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:07.610
Outside... I cannot survive 
outside of this place.

00:13:07.610 --> 00:13:11.320
But if you were to take me 
from here to run away...

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:16.240
Because you are as twisted as I.

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.740
<i>I am still uncertain why 
we could not run away</i>

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:33.750
<i>from the yokes restraining us back then.</i>

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:34.930
Fire!

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:39.500
The mansion! The lady has lost her mind!

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:53.450
The engagement has been called off.

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:56.440
She is a demon spawn.

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:58.230
I cannot handle her.

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:02.110
Charge!

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:06.700
<i>Then Lady Farnese, as though 
she were possessed,</i>

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:11.450
<i>headed an army to hunt down heretics.</i>

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:13.950
<i>Her diligent devotion to her work</i>

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:16.960
<i>astonished even the supreme court.</i>

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:26.300
We finally managed to infiltrate 
their headquarters.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:29.210
Who'd have thought an asylum 
would be their den?

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:30.970
Well done, Lady Farnese.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:32.960
Mother...

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:36.670
You, there. What did you just say?

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:40.340
<i>Why? Why is my mother here?</i>

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:43.230
Oh, Lord...

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:45.840
<i>This must be some kind of mistake.</i>

00:14:46.430 --> 00:14:50.740
<i>Because my mother... My mother 
comprehends nothing anymore.</i>

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:52.540
Serpico?

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.000
Mother...

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:58.450
Did you just say that is your mother?

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:00.750
You say your mother is among them?

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:02.880
That isn't true!

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:06.510
No heretic is among the relatives 
of a Holy Iron Chain Knight!

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:09.200
But I'm certain I heard him.

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:12.940
If this is true, it's a major problem.

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:33.190
You throw the flame.

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:33.980
Lady Far—

00:15:36.090 --> 00:15:40.640
Prove it to me! Prove that 
she is not your mother!

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:44.410
Swear to me once more...

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:47.310
I am your master...

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:49.660
Only I.

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:57.910
From now... until forever.

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:02.750
<i>What did we burn away?</i>

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:05.300
<i>From what were we delivered?</i>

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.880
<i>And by what were we tied down?</i>

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:13.770
It's flurrying. Let us depart.

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:18.920
<i>Lady Farnese is chasing 
that Black Swordsman.</i>

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:24.460
<i>As though she tries to melt 
the snow with flame.</i>

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:35.790
You can do it! Just a little 
more, and it'll be dawn!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:40.180
Hey, Casca! It's dangerous over there!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:42.920
Guts!

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:56.450
Guts!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.480
Stop...

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:04.460
Stop it!

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:15.460
Hey... Casca!

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:18.840
Thank goodness...

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:23.680
Casca...

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:30.470
Casca!

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:44.360
Hey, come on. This is going too far.

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:46.790
At this point, it's like the witch hunt.

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:48.460
What else can I do?

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:51.840
Well, you have a point...

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:54.340
But she'll just dislike you even more.

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:56.330
Right now, the most important things

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:58.470
are protecting Casca and traveling fast.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:17:59.850
I don't care about anything else.

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:09.040
Trouble! This isn't good, Guts!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.930
Wake up! Wake up!

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:14.790
If we don't hurry, the sun will set. 
Let's split up and find her.

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:17.700
<i>Casca...</i>

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:21.420
Oh, man...

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:24.890
All the nearby villages 
and towns are empty.

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:26.890
Nothing to eat.

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:30.130
You know, I think we've about 
reached the end of the line.

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:32.380
It's good the authorities aren't after us,

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:35.410
but if we run into Kushans, we're done.

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:36.740
No kiddin'.

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:38.340
I'm not picky,

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:42.350
but I wanna break the habit of water 
in our bellies and no women.

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:43.890
Hey!

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.750
My jerky!

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:51.440
Well, aren't you a pretty, little thing?

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:53.530
You're gonna violate a pilgrim?

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:55.150
There'll be divine punishment.

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:56.300
Nah, man.

00:18:56.300 --> 00:19:01.790
This must be a gift sent from 
God to poor bandits like us.

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:05.090
Well, guess that works.

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:08.060
Thanks, God!

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:13.540
<i>Casca!</i>

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:33.690
<i>Casca!</i>

00:19:53.190 --> 00:19:54.130
Cas...

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:00.380
Don't!

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.340
<i>I...</i>

00:20:57.930 --> 00:21:01.470
Hey, Casca!

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:03.960
If we don't hurry and find her, it'll be...

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:06.530
Oh, that's...

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:09.110
Hey, Dropey!

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:10.790
Well, if it isn't Dropey!

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:13.410
Puck! I hinally 'ound 'ou!

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:17.740
Oh, my...

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:20.120
You caught him?

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:20.670
Oh?

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:23.670
We've got some visitors!

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:25.960
Hey.

00:21:25.960 --> 00:21:26.680
Hi.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:28.430
You guys...

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:31.590
Ever since that day, I've been 
searching for you like crazy!

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:33.850
You won't get away from me that easy.

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:36.940
Wait, where's Casca?

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:39.040
Oh, yeah! Casca!

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:41.190
Thank goodness... You're safe!

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:44.340
What? What happened?

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:46.650
Why is Casca all tied up?

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.310
It's for her own safety.

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:50.780
Huh...

00:21:52.630 --> 00:21:54.830
What do you want?

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:58.070
You still plan to capture me?

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:00.260
Lady Farnese...

00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:16.480
Black Swordsman,

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:20.170
please let us accompany 
you on your journey.

00:23:57.020 --> 00:24:00.910
<b><i>Next Episode Preview</i></b>

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:05.000
<b>My enemies, your pardon
for being on horseback.</b>

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:09.050
<b>There are things that will probably 
surprise you even more.</b>

00:24:11.180 --> 00:24:13.340
<b>I have already secularized myself...</b>

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:17.510
<b>When was the last time she smiled?</b>

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.520
<b>That group of lights... 
Where is it going?</b>

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:25.360
<b><i>Next Episode 
Banner of the Flying Sword</i></b>

00:24:25.360 --> 00:24:27.360
<b><i></i></b>
